-- 57 barangays of Catbalogan City (official PSA PSGC names, via PhilAtlas, checked 2026-10-06). Upsert: re-runnable, renames reach the remote.
-- 26 served by CWD (WSP p.8; service_level level_iii/level_i) + 31 unserved (outside the piped network; PSGC list, no WSP data).
-- `name` = official PSGC name; `wsp_name` = the WSP spelling where it differs (search alias). Ids are stable.
-- lat/lng are approximate OSM centroids (Nominatim, 2026-10-06; query "<official name>, Catbalogan, Samar", result kept only if display_name contains "Catbalogan"), not survey data.
-- All 26 served and all 31 unserved rows have one (a NULL means no match). Some are island/upland barangays: a centroid does not imply a walkable road.
-- Household counts are unknown (not in the WSP): NULL. zone is NULL: the p.17 zoning map (Fig. 4.0)
-- has no barangay labels, so membership cannot be read from it.
on conflict (barangay_id) do update set
  name = excluded.name,
  wsp_name = excluded.wsp_name,
  service_level = excluded.service_level,
  lat = coalesce(excluded.lat, barangays.lat),
  lng = coalesce(excluded.lng, barangays.lng);
